# Input

```scss
@at-root (without  : /* biome-ignore format: keep rules */ media   supports) {.root{color:red}}
@at-root (without  : /* biome-ignore format: keep rules */ /* keep */ media   supports) {.mixed{color:blue}}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@at-root (without: /* biome-ignore format: keep rules */ media   supports) {
	.root {
		color: red;
	}
}
@at-root (
	without: /* biome-ignore format: keep rules */ /* keep */ media   supports
) {
	.mixed {
		color: blue;
	}
}

```
